--- task
id: t17
dataset: section8
kind: aggregate of an aggregate

--- intent
Across the companies that have employees, what is the average number of employees per company and the largest? Return them as `mean` and `largest`.

--- edition3
query average_headcount() {
  match { from { match { $c: Company  $p worksAt $c } return { $c, count($p) as n } } }
  return { avg($n) as mean, max($n) as largest }
}

--- edition3
query average_headcount() {
  match { from { match { $p worksAt $c } return { $c, count($p) as n } } }
  return { avg($n) as mean, max($n) as largest }
}

--- note
As `t15`: the companies without employees are outside the question.
